#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:2
msgid "CMP0232"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:6
msgid "MSVC flag ``/Zc:__cplusplus`` is passed for C++ targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:8
msgid ""
"By default, the MSVC compiler always defines the ``__cplusplus`` "
"preprocessor macro as ``199711L``, regardless of the C++ standard selected "
"by its ``/std:`` flag.  Visual Studio 2017 version 15.7 and above offer the "
"``/Zc:__cplusplus`` flag to make ``__cplusplus`` report the value of the "
"selected C++ standard, as other compilers do."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:14
msgid ""
"In CMake 4.5 and below, ``/Zc:__cplusplus`` is not passed, so sources that "
"check ``__cplusplus`` see ``199711L`` unless the project adds the flag "
"itself.  CMake 4.6 and above prefer to always pass ``/Zc:__cplusplus`` when "
"compiling C++ sources with a ``MSVC`` compiler that supports it.  This "
"policy provides compatibility for projects that have not been updated to "
"expect the behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:21
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior for this policy does not add ``/Zc:__cplusplus``. The "
"``NEW`` behavior adds ``/Zc:__cplusplus`` when compiling the C++ sources of "
"a target with the ``MSVC`` compiler from Visual Studio 2017 version 15.7 or "
"above.  The flag is not part of :variable:`CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS "
"<CMAKE_<LANG>_FLAGS>`, so it is passed regardless of that variable's value.  "
"It is placed before the target's :prop_tgt:`COMPILE_OPTIONS`, so a target "
"that needs the original value of the macro under the ``NEW`` behavior may "
"add ``/Zc:__cplusplus-`` to its compile options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:31
msgid ""
"The policy setting is recorded by each target when it is created.  It is "
"also propagated to the test projects of the :command:`try_compile` "
"and :command:`try_run` commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0232.rst:35
msgid ""
"This policy has no effect on other languages, on compilers whose id is not "
"``MSVC``, or on versions of it that do not support the flag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/STANDARD_ADVICE.rst:1
msgid ""
"This policy was introduced in CMake version |INTRODUCED_IN_CMAKE_VERSION|. "
"It may be set by :command:`cmake_policy` "
"or :command:`cmake_minimum_required`. If it is not set, CMake |"
"WARNS_OR_DOES_NOT_WARN|, and uses ``OLD`` behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/DEPRECATED.rst:2
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior of a policy is :ref:`deprecated by definition <cmake-"
"policies-intro>` and may be removed in a future version of CMake."
msgstr ""
